WEBVTT

00:08.710 --> 00:12.210
(Note: The sign says "Wine.")

00:20.510 --> 00:23.810
A blackout? Hey, Onii-chan, the power is out.

00:23.810 --> 00:25.190
I know.

00:30.510 --> 00:32.710
Is Nanami going to be okay?

00:33.110 --> 00:34.630
Let's go back to our rooms.

00:35.310 --> 00:35.760
Okay.

00:39.710 --> 00:42.740
Now you have to behave yourself and stay in your room.

00:42.910 --> 00:43.660
Okay.

01:00.310 --> 01:01.280
Nanami.

01:06.330 --> 01:09.420
Ken-chan, I'm so scared!

01:09.460 --> 01:10.490
Nanami!

01:11.110 --> 01:12.910
I want to go over to your side too.

01:12.910 --> 01:15.730
I-Idiot, it's dangerous, don't do it!

01:16.410 --> 01:17.480
B-But...

01:21.910 --> 01:23.160
It hurts...

01:25.010 --> 01:25.870
Nanami!

01:29.210 --> 01:30.610
Ken-chan.

01:30.710 --> 01:32.830
Nanami, move over.

01:38.530 --> 01:40.560
K-Ken-chan, it's dangerous.

01:40.560 --> 01:42.160
It's all right, move over!

01:57.710 --> 01:59.390
Nanami, move further away...

02:09.210 --> 02:11.680
Ken-chan, are you okay?

02:23.710 --> 02:26.940
Hmm, let me show you something really cool.

02:27.110 --> 02:28.510
Something very cool?

02:28.710 --> 02:32.110
Yeah, don't tell anybody else, okay?

02:37.510 --> 02:39.170
Idiot, what are you doing?

02:39.210 --> 02:43.240
It's alright... check this out.

02:51.670 --> 02:53.570
See? I told you it was really cool.

02:53.910 --> 02:55.230
Yeah, I'm so surprised.

02:58.010 --> 02:59.320
What's wrong?

03:00.610 --> 03:03.680
I-Is this the secret you were talking about?

03:03.710 --> 03:06.410
Yeah, don't tell anybody, okay?

03:06.870 --> 03:09.890
Since I'm only showing this to Ken-chan.

03:10.010 --> 03:11.260
I know.

03:16.910 --> 03:19.310
Well... hmm, Ken-chan.

03:19.410 --> 03:20.310
What?

03:20.510 --> 03:22.800
I really want to thank you for today.

03:23.610 --> 03:26.490
I-Idiot, why're you saying this so suddenly?

03:27.610 --> 03:29.780
I owe you a favor too now.

03:31.110 --> 03:34.150
For a favor like that, I can loan you as many as you want.

03:36.140 --> 03:37.700
I-It was nothing, really.

03:38.710 --> 03:39.650
Here you go.

03:40.510 --> 03:42.850
If you don't get yourself dry, you'll get sick for sure.

03:47.210 --> 03:52.000
Typhoon Night and the End of Summer

04:13.310 --> 04:16.140
Hey, what should we plant next year?

04:16.910 --> 04:18.960
We should at least grow some pumpkins.

04:19.510 --> 04:22.100
The pumpkin pudding from last time was really delicious.

04:22.410 --> 04:25.690
But pumpkins are heavy, it would be hard on you.

04:26.340 --> 04:28.810
Are you still going to help me with the harvest?

04:28.810 --> 04:30.180
I won't, they're heavy.

04:30.410 --> 04:32.960
Ah, you refused me so easily?

04:34.830 --> 04:38.430
And I guess we should mass produce some "Nanami specials" as well.

04:38.030 --> 04:41.310
(Note: The watermelon says: "Nanami special, don't eat.")

04:41.310 --> 04:43.300
But watermelons are heavy too.

04:43.710 --> 04:45.660
I'll help you out then.

04:47.880 --> 04:48.410
Okay!

04:49.410 --> 04:50.570
How about we take a break?

05:00.110 --> 05:01.740
I was scolded after all.

05:02.110 --> 05:02.960
Yeah...

05:03.910 --> 05:06.960
That hasn't happened to me in a long time.

05:07.910 --> 05:09.650
Yeah, me neither.

05:17.110 --> 05:20.050
It looks like that typhoon is coming after all.

05:20.210 --> 05:23.780
Yeah, how about you go ahead to the wind-break.

05:24.110 --> 05:26.050
I'll try to find a way to prevent flooding.

05:27.410 --> 05:28.150
What's wrong?

05:28.620 --> 05:30.540
I just feel a little... lately.

05:30.710 --> 05:31.530
Are you okay?

05:31.910 --> 05:35.760
Yeah, I'm fine, it's over already.

05:36.210 --> 05:37.390
Don't push yourself.

05:37.810 --> 05:38.730
Thanks.

05:49.350 --> 05:50.480
Let's duel.

05:51.510 --> 05:54.240
This one... no, that one.

06:00.910 --> 06:03.090
Great! I won!

06:03.220 --> 06:05.570
Ah, I'm the last one again.

06:16.510 --> 06:18.210
Mother, towel, towel.

06:18.410 --> 06:19.500
Welcome back.

06:20.910 --> 06:22.480
Such a heavy rain out there.

06:22.610 --> 06:24.960
Yeah, it rained all of a sudden.

06:25.110 --> 06:26.460
Here.

06:33.610 --> 06:35.660
Ken-chan, you'll get cold too.

06:37.710 --> 06:39.650
What a warm scene.

06:39.690 --> 06:44.430
Yeah, such an intimate scene right as they get back.

06:44.710 --> 06:47.430
Ah, no, this is...

06:47.810 --> 06:49.940
You don't have to hide.

06:50.010 --> 06:52.680
Yeah, yeah, we all know about "that."

06:53.010 --> 06:54.270
Right?

06:54.320 --> 06:55.390
You three...

06:55.610 --> 06:56.560
Girls...

07:04.710 --> 07:07.260
Ah, the window upstairs is still open.

07:07.380 --> 07:09.440
That's bad, I have to close it now.

07:09.910 --> 07:12.720
I'm worried about the house too, I guess I should get going as well.

07:13.010 --> 07:14.610
Well, let's all go back together.

07:15.430 --> 07:17.860
(Note: The sign says "Preparing.")

07:21.110 --> 07:23.800
Nanami, are you going to be okay by yourself?

07:24.090 --> 07:26.610
I'll be fine, see you.

07:37.810 --> 07:42.700
This is the hallway, bathroom, kitchen, Mom's room, and...

07:43.510 --> 07:45.230
My room.

07:45.410 --> 07:46.980
All checked.

07:49.810 --> 07:51.320
It hurts...

08:21.210 --> 08:22.220
All right!

08:28.460 --> 08:30.650
Ah, it's been worn quite a bit.

08:30.910 --> 08:33.160
I've been using it for several years now.

08:34.210 --> 08:37.260
Geez, you should throw it away then.

08:38.010 --> 08:41.630
No, I won't throw it away.

08:43.320 --> 08:47.020
That's because this is a very important pin to me.

08:53.110 --> 08:56.140
Well, how about we find it a new friend?

08:56.320 --> 08:57.910
New friend?

08:57.910 --> 09:01.540
Yeah, that guy must be really lonely by himself, right?

09:02.010 --> 09:05.290
Hmm, what do you mean by that?

09:05.310 --> 09:07.330
Well, you'll see.

09:14.710 --> 09:18.100
Is Nanami going to be okay?

09:24.310 --> 09:27.390
Now's the time.

09:28.610 --> 09:29.670
All right!

09:29.910 --> 09:31.300
Huh? What is it?

09:37.510 --> 09:38.590
One, two, three...

09:38.780 --> 09:39.410
Nanami!

09:39.510 --> 09:40.560
Jump!

09:51.260 --> 09:52.860
I'm here to play.

09:57.610 --> 10:00.850
I see, you're here to play.

10:01.610 --> 10:05.830
Yeah, I thought you would be lonely by yourself...

10:06.210 --> 10:06.770
Ouch!

10:06.800 --> 10:08.610
Idiot! That was dangerous.

10:08.810 --> 10:11.200
But you do that all the time...

10:11.410 --> 10:13.430
Don't jump over here next time!

10:13.810 --> 10:15.400
I understand...

10:15.410 --> 10:16.340
Geez.

10:33.610 --> 10:36.150
The rain's getting heavier and heavier.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.410
Yeah.

10:37.410 --> 10:39.490
Is the power going to go out again?

10:39.520 --> 10:41.380
That's possible.

10:44.010 --> 10:46.050
I don't want it getting dark again.

10:50.910 --> 10:54.010
Ah, yeah! Hey, hey.

10:54.210 --> 10:56.470
Okay, you should get back now.

10:56.860 --> 11:01.450
Ah, wait, I didn't say anything yet.

11:01.610 --> 11:03.870
You want me to do something after all, right?

11:06.110 --> 11:06.820
What is it?

11:07.310 --> 11:09.840
Hmm, can I stay here overnight?

11:10.610 --> 11:11.300
Huh?

11:11.710 --> 11:13.880
Save your dreaming for when you fall asleep, okay?

11:15.310 --> 11:16.840
Why can't I?

11:22.510 --> 11:24.860
Only during the typhoon will I give you this special deal.

11:25.110 --> 11:26.740
Is this a new rule?

11:27.610 --> 11:28.730
It's been a while, hasn't it?

11:41.610 --> 11:43.770
T-That thunder was really close.

11:44.010 --> 11:46.800
Hmm, hmm, sorry.

11:51.210 --> 11:52.530
The power is out.

11:52.910 --> 11:54.680
Yeah, it happens all the time.

11:55.810 --> 11:57.990
It's still shining.

12:01.310 --> 12:04.800
Yeah, it will shine forever.

12:19.310 --> 12:21.860
It's dark, I'll go get a candle.

12:29.110 --> 12:31.430
All right, wait here.

12:35.210 --> 12:36.250
It hurts...

12:37.410 --> 12:38.540
What's wrong, Nanami?

12:39.590 --> 12:40.980
I'm fine.

12:42.510 --> 12:44.680
You don't feel well? Does it still hurt?

12:44.910 --> 12:46.560
A little.

12:47.310 --> 12:49.600
Wait for me, I'm taking you to the hospital right now!

12:54.710 --> 12:55.650
It's thunder.

12:55.700 --> 12:57.250
I like this feeling.

13:00.310 --> 13:01.230
Onii-chan?

13:01.610 --> 13:03.550
What's wrong? Why are you in a hurry?

13:08.710 --> 13:09.370
Darn!

13:09.710 --> 13:11.210
Onii-chan, what's wrong?

13:11.810 --> 13:13.380
What are you doing?

13:13.510 --> 13:15.380
Shut up, Nanami is...

13:15.910 --> 13:17.550
Nanami came over?

13:18.110 --> 13:21.050
If something happens to Nanami... I'll...

13:22.310 --> 13:25.570
Kenji, calm down, what's wrong with Nanami?

13:29.710 --> 13:31.050
What's wrong?

13:31.810 --> 13:33.990
She said it hurt while we were talking.

13:34.610 --> 13:35.740
How about an ambulance?

13:36.110 --> 13:37.280
The phone is out.

13:37.610 --> 13:38.560
Oh no...

13:39.110 --> 13:41.010
Oh yeah, my bike.

13:41.210 --> 13:46.000
Idiot, if she feels that bad, how can she hold you tight on the back of your bike?

13:47.210 --> 13:49.970
But in that case, Nanami will...

13:57.510 --> 13:59.370
The wagon would be really easy.

13:59.810 --> 14:01.140
Do you want to use the wagon?

14:01.710 --> 14:04.190
The wagon is finally useful.

14:05.610 --> 14:08.010
Yeah, if I use that...

14:15.530 --> 14:18.150
Are you really going to use that to take her to the hospital?

14:18.510 --> 14:21.540
It's all I can think of, I've got no choice.

14:21.730 --> 14:22.950
Even though you're right...

14:28.580 --> 14:30.580
Please contact her mom, you two.

14:33.610 --> 14:36.350
Let's go, Nanami, bear with it for now.

15:15.410 --> 15:17.620
Don't give up, we'll be there soon enough.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.790
New friend?

15:45.370 --> 15:47.590
Hmm, what is it?

15:59.910 --> 16:01.680
This is really troublesome.

16:01.820 --> 16:03.360
That's what I'm here for.

16:03.970 --> 16:06.200
Then, here I go!

16:17.240 --> 16:19.550
That looks like a lot of work!

16:19.830 --> 16:21.990
You can't have mine!

16:22.170 --> 16:23.000
Ken-chan.

16:24.060 --> 16:26.540
Ken-chan, I'll share mine with you,

16:26.740 --> 16:28.140
so don't bully Suzuka-chan.

16:31.020 --> 16:35.120
Ken-chan, I came here yesterday just to teach you...

16:35.450 --> 16:37.120
Have you already forgotten?

16:39.940 --> 16:42.780
You need to be more careful with your tie...

16:45.400 --> 16:47.960
Ken-chan, it's morning!

16:48.600 --> 16:50.040
Wake up!

16:50.520 --> 16:51.380
Ken-chan!

17:09.010 --> 17:10.110
Tomosaka-kun.

17:14.290 --> 17:17.550
Oba-san, N-Nanami is...

17:18.010 --> 17:21.830
The doctor said it was appendicitis, but now she's fine.

17:22.210 --> 17:24.650
Thank you so much... for what you did for her.

17:26.810 --> 17:28.040
I see.

17:34.710 --> 17:35.550
Nanami.

17:36.010 --> 17:41.760
Ken-chan, well, umm...

17:50.410 --> 17:51.580
Ken-chan...

17:54.010 --> 17:54.510
You're crying...

17:54.510 --> 17:55.690
Now you owe me another favor.

17:58.110 --> 18:01.350
If that's the case, you now owe me forty-seven, right?

18:03.010 --> 18:06.350
If you don't watch out, I might pass you.

18:08.810 --> 18:09.880
Yeah...

18:11.210 --> 18:14.900
I'll take care of the field for you until you come back.

18:31.720 --> 18:33.640
Alright, I'm going to do it.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.620
Ah, she's here, she's here.

19:36.510 --> 19:39.810
Nanami onee-chan, congratulations on coming home.

19:39.810 --> 19:41.060
Congratulations.

19:42.110 --> 19:43.540
Thank you, everybody.

19:43.570 --> 19:48.370
Speaking of which, how come Kenji isn't here? That unfaithful man.

19:48.710 --> 19:51.710
Onii-chan is out today.

19:51.710 --> 19:55.580
Yeah, I haven't seen him in the store lately either.

19:55.910 --> 19:58.050
Maybe, he's there.

19:59.810 --> 20:02.820
All right, let's go back and hold a recovery party.

20:06.610 --> 20:07.700
This will be good.

20:08.910 --> 20:12.550
Alright, I have to go to the hospital and pick up Nanami.

20:48.210 --> 20:49.370
Ken-chan?

20:58.470 --> 21:00.860
(Note: The sign says "Congratulations on coming back." and the watermelon says: "Nanami, this is for you.")

21:15.110 --> 21:20.360
Ken-chan? Where are you hiding?

21:22.940 --> 21:26.680
The favors we owed each other since childhood.

21:27.040 --> 21:29.930
Every single one of them was a treasurable memory of the bond between us.

21:29.940 --> 21:32.030
I always thought the time we had together was a natural thing.

21:32.720 --> 21:37.380
The distance we kept from each other was the same.

21:37.940 --> 21:41.720
But those were the most precious treasures I'd ever have.

21:42.040 --> 21:42.810
But...

21:43.940 --> 21:47.620
Next episode of Lamune: 100 Loans and 100 Debts

21:46.690 --> 21:51.690
